<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Week 12 HA Cluster</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding-top: 60px; background: #f4f6f8; }
    h1 { color: #14532d; }
    #who { display: inline-block; background: #14532d; color: #fff;
           padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: monospace; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>🌍 Distributed Service Cluster — Week 12 Capstone</h1>
  <p>This page lives on <b>shared NFS storage</b> owned by Node 3.</p>
  <p>Served by worker: <span id="who">…</span></p>
  <script>
    fetch('/node.txt')
      .then(r => r.text())
      .then(t => document.getElementById('who').textContent = t.trim());
  </script>
</body>
</html>
